Z||000000||sqoach||11-13-2001||10:15 PM||||Any suggestions? Both his keys are in the truck. He just moved to New Mexico. He was stationed there because he's in the Air Force. He said he can't call a locksmith because they're not allowed there ??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><BR>Anyway, he needs to get in, of course. He has one of those sliding windows on back. He's tried opening it, but not getting very far.<BR>I've found a nissan frontier message board, but I can't seem to post a message. And their stupid search doesn't work. I can't find anything else. Need help!<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">               <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||4
