Z||000006||sqoach||11-14-2001||11:24 AM||||Ok, ok. He got a locksmith to go out there and unlock it for him. I'm not sure why he said they couldn't. Surprised me, but I wasn't gonna argue cuz I'm not on a base, or whatever.<BR>The reason he has both keys on his keychain (what he told me, anyway) is because the key is too big to fit in his wallet. Has that plastic coating around it.<BR>Roger, no he's not blonde. Seems that way at times, though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Now I can make fun of him again. He did the same thing with his other car about a year ago. Hehe.||||reg||1
